curl <span class="tok-url">https://tofupass.com/api/password?lang=es</span>

<span class="tok-comment"># 日本パスフレーズ</span>
curl <span class="tok-url">https://tofupass.com/api/passphrase?count=4&amp;lang=ja</span></pre>
